# Faculty of Engineering - Course Syllabus CS402

Course Title: Distributed Systems and Cloud Computing

Semester: Fall 2026 | Credits: 3.0

<!-- pagebreak: page 2 -->

## Assessment Matrix & Grade Distribution

| Assessment Component | Weight | Due Week |
|---|---|---|
| Midterm Examination | 25% | Week 7 |
| Programming Assignments (4x) | 30% | Weeks 3, 6, 9, 12 |
| Term Project & Presentation | 15% | Week 14 |
| Final Comprehensive Exam | 30% | Week 16 |

